<description>&lt;p&gt;Egypt reopened its embassy in Tripoli, restoring diplomatic ties after a 12-year gap. ISIS militants killed a young Christian man in Libya after he refused to deny Jesus. A fire triggered an explosion at a Libyan gas complex, killing one worker and injuring four. Libyan authorities detained a translator, prompting PC to demand his release, and arrested a man in Tripoli for throwing grenades at the army. Libya and Chad signed the final document of the CEN-SAD Executive Council meeting. Combat intensity remains low, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUmxJSTBtNC0zNWtPUkRhQ1JxS2dCRndtN3o1cURid3ZkdTRjTmthSmRubHJONFNBYlFLT1MwVGVyUENyNnYyYTU3Rnp5YjRSa3Z0NWprOWl6ckx4T3hXS3dGeThhZjlzWHFZSDNrX2VabUlaZWhKQUJORlJBYlFqNTJNYWRCaWcxLWhDTkxIRVl2Q2JvYlFVajdlN050dlI0?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9DU1A1RDZfTHZpSkthYlNpN0dUb2FjSzR1THV5Tk80R3h6Qy1DNmg0WW90QmZHWnpCNk1KTkZMd1pjRkRmRzdZR2x5VFRtTG9YejVYRHBpRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNOTluNENsTWRxSUNEQnhFbXIteFRua3g4eDRvMUZOejF1anc5QWo0Q0I4S0IwTlZXRzJzVE45QzN2QkVWZ3FsTEZTQ3NUYkdhMFJ0UFlMNENMamN4d3RjZ0o1OGNCSW5TVzlSeVowOUV3N2t5X1hjdjRrOFFESmZuWlJuOHZGcDRUVUh2aWZyeDRqWWh6emFqTVpNR1JJUTMtNHFXZk1rVnFDOXFJTjlBcFQ0ZVZyZVlqRWJMajBuaDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;zagazola.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQd1RIUG9sU2tuVm5TNGV4R2hiZWFNaF9GbXIyUVZ4dHpGd2tVZXBYZU9iRzNDZUlFZjkxYWNYVG5tQUxJM0ppbXBISzdkaTR5eFhUV2FCVTBNSkJKeGpQdE5MaUE5QWZtQU9EOEVUdU5YUVBZcGxLVjFBWl8zUGUxckE0TmExS1hVRWdPWTlGcnFJVlRpMkNpa1VQQXBSYlpObUpGUFJlUi1aT3BILXFMektGeml3SW8?oc